lass=\"font-accent text-gold text-xs tracking-widest uppercase block mb-2\">ዮሐ 14:6</span><h3 class=\"font-display text-white text-lg font-bold leading-tight\">ክርስቶስ ብቸኛ መንገድ ነው</h3><p class=\"font-body text-white/40 text-xs mt-1\">Christ Is the Only Way</p></div><div class=\"p-6\"><p class=\"font-body text-[#6a5a50] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">ኢየሱስ ክርስቶስ ብቸኛ መንገድ፣ ሕይወት እና ዕውነት ናቸው። ሌሎች ሁሉ ሞትን ይመራሉ።</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-4 border-t border-gray-100\"><div><span class=\"font-body text-church-dark text-xs font-semibold block\">ፓስተር ቤዛ ሜርኔ</span><span class=\"font-accent text-[#9a8a80] text-xs italic\">10 ማርች 2026</span></div></div></div><div class=\"w-full aspect-video\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tNpK5rXqzv8\" title=\"ክርስቶስ ብቸኛ መንገድ ነው\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowFullScreen=\"\" class=\"w-full h-full\"></iframe></div></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-church-dark border-t border-gold/15\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-16\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\"><div class=\"relative w-14 h-14 rounded-full border-2 border-gold overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div><p class=\"font-display text-gold text-base font-bold\">Christ Saints&#x27; Church</p><p class=\"font-body text-white/40 text-xs\">ክርስቶስ ቅዱሳን ቤተክርስቲያን</p></div></div><p class=\"font-body text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed mt-4\">ፍቅር፣ ተስፋ፣ ሕይወት — በኢየሱስ ክርስቶስ ስም አብሮ እናገለግላለን።</p></div><div><h4 class=\"font-accent text-gold text-lg mb-5 tracking-widest uppercase text-sm\">Links</h4><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li><a class=\"font-body text-white/50 hover:text-gold transition-colors text-sm\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"font-body text-white/50 hover:text-gold transition-colors text-sm\" href=\"/pastor\">Pastor</a></li><li><a class=\"font-body text-white/50 hover:text-gold transition-colors text-sm\" href=\"/sermons\">Sermons</a></li><li><a class=\"font-body text-white/50 hover:text-gold transition-colors text-sm\" href=\"/events\">Events</a></li><li><a class=\"font-body text-white/50 hover:text-gold transition-colors text-sm\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"font-accent text-gold tracking-widest uppercase text-sm mb-5\">Worship Schedule</h4><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-gold flex-shrink-0\"></div><div><span class=\"font-body text-white/70 text-sm\">Sunday<!-- --> — <!-- -->2:00 - 4:30 PM</span><span class=\"font-body text-white/35 text-xs block\">Worship</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-gold flex-shrink-0\"></div><div><span class=\"font-body text-white/70 text-sm\">Wednesday<!-- --> — <!-- -->7:00 - 8:30 PM</span><span class=\"font-body text-white/35 text-xs block\">Bible Study</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-gold flex-shrink-0\"></div><div><span class=\"font-body text-white/70 text-sm\">Saturday<!-- --> — <!-- -->11:00 AM - 1:00 PM</span><span class=\"font-body text-white/35 text-xs block\">Prayer Meeting (Every Two Weeks)</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-gold flex-shrink-0\"></div><div><span class=\"font-body text-white/70 text-sm\">Sunday<!-- --> — <!-- -->2:00 - 4:30 PM</span><span class=\"font-body text-white/35 text-xs block\">Youth Group (Sunday School)</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-gold flex-shrink-0\"></div><div><span class=\"font-body text-white/70 text-sm\">Saturday<!-- --> — <!-- -->11:00 AM - 7:00 PM</span><span class=\"font-body text-white/35 text-xs block\">Evangelism (Every Two Weeks)</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-gold/10 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4\"><p class=\"font-body text-white/30 text-xs\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- -->Christ Saints&#x27; Church. ሁሉም መብቶች የተጠበቁ ናቸው።</p><p class=\"font-accent italic text-gold/40 text-sm\">“ኢየሱስ ክርስቶስ ትናንትና ዛሬ ለዘለዓለምም አንድ ነው” — ዕብ 13:8</p></div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2zjueh7t2vecu.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[62319,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3bk0cpzuomv-5.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3bk0cpzuomv-5.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3bk0cpzuomv-5.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[5500,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3bk0cpzuomv-5.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"Image\\\"]\\n6:I[22016,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3bk0cpzuomv-5.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\nd:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3bk0cpzuomv-5.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-